PUT /api/v1/users/me/notification-preferences
{"email_digest": true, "push": false}
→ 200 OK
// No ETag, no If-Match.

// Spec: "Only the owning user may write their own preferences; there is no admin or
//        batch writer for this resource. Concurrent writes resolve last-write-wins.
//        A lost update means one toggle from one of the user's own two tabs is
//        discarded; the user sees current state on reload."
// No T4 contention: single writer by construction.
